      * I-RLU sample printer file - AFPDS device type, expanded keyword coverage

                                            PAGSIZE(66 132) DEVTYPE(*AFPDS)    -
                                            FONT(2304) DUPLEX(*YES) OUTBIN(1)
                R STMTHDR                   STRPAGGRP SKIPB(1) PAGSEG(COMPLOGO -
                                            0.5 0.5) OVERLAY(STMTFORM 0 0)
                                        1 40'CUSTOMER STATEMENT' CDEFNT(920    -
                                            *CURLIB) COLOR(*BLU)
                  CUSTNAME      30A  O  3 10CHRSIZ(1.5 1.5) COLOR(*RGB 0 0 0)
                  ACCTBAL       11S 2O  3 90CDEFNT(&CURFONT)
                R STMTFTR                   SKIPB(2) ENDPAGGRP
                                        1  1'Thank you for your business.'
